r":804,"link_td_description":"李景略，幽州良乡县（今北京市房山区东南）人，唐朝将领。","link_td_id":"Q10022667","link_td_number_id":7910387,"people_name":"景略","people_name_jianti_auto":"景略","people_xingming":"李景略","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"c2840828-db0e-11ef-9718-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"任迪简，京兆万年（今陕西省西安市）人，唐朝义武节度使，去世后被追赠为刑部尚书，谥襄。","link_td_id":"Q10022062","link_td_number_id":7452362,"people_name":"任迪簡","people_name_jianti_auto":"任迪简","people_xingming":"任迪简","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"c284082b-db0e-11ef-aebd-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":750,"link_death_year":804,"link_td_description":"李景略，幽州良乡县（今北京市房山区东南）人，唐朝将领。","link_td_id":"Q10022667","link_td_number_id":7910387,"people_name":"景略","people_name_jianti_auto":"景略","people_xingming":"李景略","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"c284082c-db0e-11ef-8c6f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":750,"link_death_year":804,"link_td_description":"李景略，幽州良乡县（今北京市房山区东南）人，唐朝将领。","link_td_id":"Q10022667","link_td_number_id":7910387,"people_name":"李景略","people_name_jianti_auto":"李景略","people_xingming":"李景略","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"c284082e-db0e-11ef-863a-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":750,"link_death_year":804,"link_td_description":"李景略，幽州良乡县（今北京市房山区东南）人，唐朝将领。","link_td_id":"Q10022667","link_td_number_id":7910387,"people_name":"景略","people_name_jianti_auto":"景略","people_xingming":"李景略","start_index":125,"tongjian_id":"c284082f-db0e-11ef-b6b2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"c2840823-db0e-11ef-83f7-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"xī","source_anchor_text":"酒者誤以醯進判官京","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":42,"text":"醯","tongjian_id":"3e63aa19-b053-5e83-a1a9-924bdecf4a75"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"c2840823-db0e-11ef-83f7-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"jiōng","source_anchor_text":"室軍士發扃取之監軍","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":113,"text":"扃","tongjian_id":"9d9e4a3b-6e81-5e10-adcc-12e56b88e57c"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"天德軍","place_name_jianti_auto":"天德军","resolved_place_entity_id":1330,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c2840829-db0e-11ef-8d4a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"豐州","place_name_jianti_auto":"丰州","resolved_place_entity_id":1071,"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"c284082a-db0e-11ef-a4ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京兆","place_name_jianti_auto":"京兆","resolved_place_entity_id":217,"start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"c284082d-db0e-11ef-997f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"1春，正月，丙戌，天德軍都防禦團練使、豐州刺史李景略卒。初，景略嘗宴僚佐，行酒者誤以醯進。判官京兆任迪簡以景略性嚴，恐行酒者得罪，強飲之，歸而嘔血；軍士聞之泣下。及李景略卒，軍士皆曰判官仁者，欲奉以爲帥。監軍抱拘置別室，軍士發扃取之。監軍以聞，詔以代景略。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月初十日丙戌，天德军都防御团练使、丰州刺史李景略去世。当初，李景略曾经设宴招待僚属辅佐，倒酒的人误把醋当作酒送上来。判官、京兆府人任迪简因为李景略性情严厉，担心倒酒的人会因此获罪，便找了个由头把这些醋喝了下去，回去后不断吐血；军中将士听说后都感动得流下泪来。等到李景略去世后，军中将士都说任判官是仁德的人，打算拥立他为主帅。监军抱住任判官，把他反锁在另一间屋里，将士们打开门锁，将任判官接了出来。监军把这件事奏报朝廷，德宗下诏任命任迪简接替李景略的职务。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，丙戌，天德军都防御团练使、丰州刺史李景略卒。初，景略尝宴僚佐，行酒者误以醯进。判官京兆任迪简以景略性严，恐行酒者得罪，强饮之，归而呕血；军士闻之泣下。及李景略卒，军士皆曰判官仁者，欲奉以为帅。监军抱拘置别室，军士发扃取之。监军以闻，诏以代景略。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":23801,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c2840823-db0e-11ef-83f7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"韓愈","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩愈","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"c2840832-db0e-11ef-a58d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"薦","people_name_jianti_auto":"荐","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"c2840833-db0e-11ef-adcf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"足之煎","people_name_jianti_auto":"足之煎","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"c2840834-db0e-11ef-9135-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張薦","people_name_jianti_auto":"张荐","start_index":101,"tongjian_id":"c2840835-db0e-11ef-8e51-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：實錄及舊傳皆云：「贊普以貞元十三年四月卒，長子立，一歲，又卒，次子嗣立。」韓愈順宗實錄·張薦傳云：「二十年，贊普死，遣薦弔贈。」新傳云：「十三年，贊普死，其子足之煎立。二十年，贊普死，遣工部侍郞張薦弔祠，其弟嗣立。」疑實錄、舊傳誤以是字爲一字。今從順宗錄及新傳。按「字」當作「事」。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：实录及旧传皆云：「赞普以贞元十三年四月卒，长子立，一岁，又卒，次子嗣立。」韩愈顺宗实录·张荐传云：「二十年，赞普死，遣荐吊赠。」新传云：「十三年，赞普死，其子足之煎立。二十年，赞普死，遣工部侍郞张荐吊祠，其弟嗣立。」疑实录、旧传误以是字为一字。今从顺宗录及新传。按「字」当作「事」。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"c2840831-db0e-11ef-92cc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"吐蕃","place_name_jianti_auto":"吐蕃","resolved_place_entity_id":92,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c284083f-db0e-11ef-99eb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"2吐蕃贊普死，其弟嗣立。","content_fanyi":"吐蕃赞普去世，赞普的弟弟继位。","content_jianti_auto":"2吐蕃赞普死，其弟嗣立。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":23802,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c2840830-db0e-11ef-9130-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陳許","place_name_jianti_auto":"陈许","resolved_place_entity_id":1525,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c2840841-db0e-11ef-902a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"忠武","place_name_jianti_auto":"忠武","resolved_place_entity_id":380,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"c2840842-db0e-11ef-ba8c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"3夏，四月，丙寅，名陳許軍曰忠武。","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月二十二日丙寅，德宗下令将陈许军改名为忠武军。","content_jianti_auto":"3夏，四月，丙寅，名陈许军曰忠武。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":23803,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"c2840840-db0e-11ef-af50-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"左金吾大將軍","official_note":"左金吾大將軍是唐代禁軍將領，負責京城警衛和宮廷安全，隸屬金吾衛。在《資治通鑑》此段中，李昇雲擔任此職，率禁兵鎮守咸陽，顯示其軍事指揮職能。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"左金吾大將軍李昇雲將禁兵鎭咸陽","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"44515ae8-71e0-42d9-b8f6-eb79bf3aed21"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"虞候","official_note":"虞候是唐代軍中職務，常負責軍紀、偵察或輔助指揮，在藩鎮中尤為常見。此處上官望擔任虞候，參與謀劃效仿山東藩鎮，顯示其為軍中重要角色。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"其子政諲與虞候上官望等謀效山東藩鎭","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"b6e6b171-5435-4f87-8282-f492d1579caa"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李昇雲","people_name_jianti_auto":"李升云","people_xingming":"李昇云","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"c2840845-db0e-11ef-9249-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"政諲","people_name_jianti_auto":"政𬤇","people_xingming":"李政諲","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"c2840846-db0e-11ef-822e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"上官望","people_name_jianti_auto":"上官望","people_xingming":"上官望","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"c2840848-db0e-11ef-abde-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昇雲","people_name_jianti_auto":"升云","people_xingming":"李昇云","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"c2840849-db0e-11ef-9f60-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昇雲","people_name_jianti_auto":"升云","people_xingming":"李昇云","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"c284084a-db0e-11ef-bfdc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"咸陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"咸阳","resolved_place_entity_id":382,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"c2840847-db0e-11ef-b56a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"山","place_name_jianti_auto":"山","resolved_place_entity_id":261,"start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"c284084b-db0e-11ef-b7f9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["权争"],"content":"4左金吾大將軍李昇雲將禁兵鎭咸陽，疾病，其子政諲與虞候上官望等謀效山東藩鎭，使將士奏攝父事。六月，壬子，昇雲卒。甲寅，詔追削昇雲官爵，籍沒其家。","content_fanyi":"左金吾大将军李昇云率领禁军镇守咸阳，身患重病，他的儿子李政諲与虞候上官望等人谋划仿效山东地区藩镇的做法，指使将士上奏朝廷，请求让李政諲暂代父亲的职事。六月初九日壬子，李昇云去世。六月十一日甲寅，德宗下诏追削李昇云的官职爵位，抄没他的家产。","content_jianti_auto":"4左金吾大将军李升云将禁兵镇咸阳，疾病，其子政𬤇与虞候上官望等谋效山东藩镇，使将士奏摄父事。六月，壬子，升云卒。甲寅，诏追削升云官爵，籍没其家。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":23804,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"c2840843-db0e-11ef-aa8b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"是否接受朝廷任命为昭义节度使","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_C284084CDB0E11EFA7C3A0D3651F611F_01"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c284084e-db0e-11ef-9018-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"唐人多讀「作」如「佐」音。","note_content_jianti_auto":"唐人多读「作」如「佐」音。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"c284084d-db0e-11ef-ac84-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"來希皓","people_name_jianti_auto":"来希皓","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"c2840850-db0e-11ef-8afb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"盧從史","people_name_jianti_auto":"卢从史","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"c2840851-db0e-11ef-8faf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言若束草爲節度使，亦必敬而事之。來希皓之忠純如此，而其後不復見於史，必盧從史畏偪而去之也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言若束草为节度使，亦必敬而事之。来希皓之忠纯如此，而其后不复见于史，必卢从史畏偪而去之也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"c284084f-db0e-11ef-883c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"杜牧","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜牧","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c2840853-db0e-11ef-a4b8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"盧從史","people_name_jianti_auto":"卢从史","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"c2840854-db0e-11ef-8afd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：杜牧上李司徒書作「押衙盧從史」。今從實錄。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：杜牧上李司徒书作「押衙卢从史」。今从实录。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":137,"tongjian_id":"c2840852-db0e-11ef-a711-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"出儔伍之中而言。","note_content_jianti_auto":"出俦伍之中而言。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":154,"tongjian_id":"c2840858-db0e-11ef-a8e1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政/军事指挥","official_name":"昭義節度使","official_note":"昭義節度使是唐代地方军政长官，掌管昭义军镇的军事和行政事务。此处李长荣去世，导致节度使职位空缺，引发后续任命争议。","official_rank":"从二品至正三品","source_snippet":"昭義節度使李長榮薨","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"26e9cdec-d0db-49cd-818f-fc8441524614"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"宫廷内侍","official_name":"中使","official_note":"中使是皇帝派出的宦官使者，负责传达诏令。此处中使携带手诏前往昭义军，主持节度使的任命事宜。","official_rank":"品秩不定，多为宦官担任","source_snippet":"上使中使以手詔授本軍大將","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"7cffc232-1054-4152-9a04-2946d129c17b"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"大將","official_note":"大将是军队中的高级将领。此处指昭义军中的高级军官，皇帝计划从其中选拔新任节度使。","official_rank":"高级武官，品秩不定","source_snippet":"上使中使以手詔授本軍大將","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"de3d7ad6-789e-4e5c-9c74-7186d1145943"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政/军事指挥","official_name":"節度使","official_note":"节度使是唐代地方最高军政长官。此处来希皓表示自己虽得军心，但不适合担任节度使一职。","official_rank":"从二品至正三品","source_snippet":"但作節度使不得","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"3db4a10a-ca61-43cc-b363-1178235ecf33"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"兵馬使","official_note":"兵马使是节度使麾下的重要军职，负责统领兵马。此处卢从史以兵马使身份，在节度使空缺时谋求上位。","official_rank":"中级武官，约从四品至正五品","source_snippet":"兵馬使盧從史其位居四","start_index":142,"tongjian_id":"f869645d-3197-4271-8410-7f002f98f30c"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"監軍","official_note":"监军是皇帝派往军队的宦官，负责监督将领和军队。此处监军与卢从史勾结，影响节度使的任命。","official_rank":"品秩不定，多为宦官担任","source_snippet":"潛與監軍相結","start_index":154,"tongjian_id":"48756501-df88-4eed-8201-8903a8566c10"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"中丞","official_note":"中丞是御史台的重要官职，负责监察百官。此处可能是卢从史的兼衔或尊称，但原文未明确其具体职务。","official_rank":"正四品下","source_snippet":"盧中丞若如此","start_index":194,"tongjian_id":"d27b86d1-94b0-45fb-9e5d-6e4466e99c06"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政/军事指挥","official_name":"節度使","official_note":"节度使是唐代地方最高军政长官。此处朝廷最终下诏任命卢从史为昭义节度使，结束了军中的权力争夺。","official_rank":"从二品至正三品","source_snippet":"詔以從史爲節度使","start_index":248,"tongjian_id":"905188b0-d79f-48a4-8a65-ce7f5b33df05"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李長榮","people_name_jianti_auto":"李长荣","people_xingming":"李长荣","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c28651f0-db0e-11ef-9ba2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"來希皓","people_name_jianti_auto":"来希皓","people_xingming":"来希皓","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"c28651f1-db0e-11ef-8227-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"希皓","people_name_jianti_auto":"希皓","people_xingming":"来希皓","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"c28651f2-db0e-11ef-8d0b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"希皓","people_name_jianti_auto":"希皓","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"c28651f3-db0e-11ef-a1f0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"希皓","people_name_jianti_auto":"希皓","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"c28651f5-db0e-11ef-907e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"希皓","people_name_jianti_auto":"希皓","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"c28651f6-db0e-11ef-afb9-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":810,"link_td_description":"卢从史，唐朝军事人物。","link_td_id":"Q10006321","link_td_number_id":794875,"people_name":"盧從史","people_name_jianti_auto":"卢从史","people_xingming":"卢从史","start_index":134,"tongjian_id":"c28651f7-db0e-11ef-9b1c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"來大夫","people_name_jianti_auto":"来大夫","people_xingming":"来希皓","start_index":156,"tongjian_id":"c28651f8-db0e-11ef-9133-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":810,"link_td_description":"卢从史，唐朝军事人物。","link_td_id":"Q10006321","link_td_number_id":794875,"people_name":"從史","people_name_jianti_auto":"从史","people_xingming":"卢从史","start_index":164,"tongjian_id":"c28651f9-db0e-11ef-baeb-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":810,"link_td_description":"卢从史，唐朝军事人物。","link_td_id":"Q10006321","link_td_number_id":794875,"people_name":"盧中丞","people_name_jianti_auto":"卢中丞","people_xingming":"卢从史","start_index":179,"tongjian_id":"c28651fa-db0e-11ef-b0fc-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":810,"link_td_description":"卢从史，唐朝军事人物。","link_td_id":"Q10006321","link_td_number_id":794875,"people_name":"從史","people_name_jianti_auto":"从史","people_xingming":"卢从史","start_index":205,"tongjian_id":"c28651fb-db0e-11ef-9297-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"希皓","people_name_jianti_auto":"希皓","people_xingming":"来希皓","start_index":215,"tongjian_id":"c28651fc-db0e-11ef-b39a-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":810,"link_td_description":"卢从史，唐朝军事人物。","link_td_id":"Q10006321","link_td_number_id":794875,"people_name":"從史","people_name_jianti_auto":"从史","people_xingming":"卢从史","start_index":248,"tongjian_id":"c28651fd-db0e-11ef-95d1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"昭義","place_name_jianti_auto":"昭义","resolved_place_entity_id":289,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c28651f4-db0e-11ef-8ee1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","权争"],"content":"5昭義節度使李長榮薨，上使中使以手詔授本軍大將，但軍士所附者卽授。時大將來希皓爲衆所服，中使將以手詔付之。希皓言於衆曰：「此軍取人，合是希皓，但作節度使不得。若朝廷以一束草來，希皓亦必敬事。」中使言：「面奉進止，只令此軍取大將拔與節鉞，朝廷不別除人。」希皓固辭。兵馬使盧從史其位居四，潛與監軍相結，起出伍曰：「若來大夫不肯受詔，從史請且句當此軍。」監軍曰：「盧中丞若如此，此亦固合聖旨。」中使因探懷取詔以授之。從史奉詔，再拜舞蹈。希皓亟迴揮同列，北面稱賀。軍士畢集，更無一言。秋，八月，己未，詔以從史爲節度使。","content_fanyi":"昭义节度使李长荣去世，德宗派宫中宦官使者带着亲笔手诏，准备授给本军大将，只要将士们拥戴谁，就把主帅一职授予谁。当时，大将来希皓受众人敬服，中使准备把手诏交给他。来希皓对众人说：“在本军中挑选主帅，按理说应是我来希皓，但我自认为不适合当节度使。如果朝廷用一束草来当节度使，我也必定恭敬事奉它。”中使说：“我当面领受德宗旨意，只令本军从大将中选拔并授予节钺，朝廷不另外任命他人。”来希皓坚决推辞。兵马使卢从史在军中位居第四，暗中与监军相勾结，这时从同列中站出来说：“如果来大夫不肯接受诏命，请让我暂且管理本军。”监军说：“卢中丞若肯如此，这自然也合乎圣意。”中使于是从怀中取出诏书授予卢从史。卢从史捧着诏书，拜了两拜，高兴得手舞足蹈。来希皓急忙转身指挥同列将士，面朝北方称贺。将士们全部集合，再没有一个人提出异议。秋季八月十七日，己未，德宗下诏任命卢从史为节度使。","content_jianti_auto":"5昭义节度使李长荣薨，上使中使以手诏授本军大将，但军士所附者即授。时大将来希皓为众所服，中使将以手诏付之。希皓言于众曰：「此军取人，合是希皓，但作节度使不得。若朝廷以一束草来，希皓亦必敬事。」中使言：「面奉进止，只令此军取大将拔与节钺，朝廷不别除人。」希皓固辞。兵马使卢从史其位居四，潜与监军相结，起出伍曰：「若来大夫不肯受诏，从史请且句当此军。」监军曰：「卢中丞若如此，此亦固合圣旨。」中使因探怀取诏以授之。从史奉诏，再拜舞蹈。希皓亟回挥同列，北面称贺。军士毕集，更无一言。秋，八月，己未，诏以从史为节度使。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":23805,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c284084c-db0e-11ef-a7c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"6九月，太子始得風疾，不能言。","content_fanyi":"九月，太子开始患上风疾，不能说话。","content_jianti_auto":"6九月，太子始得风疾，不能言。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":23806,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"c28651fe-db0e-11ef-91e2-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"二十年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"二十年","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"c2840821-db0e-11ef-96d4-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（甲申、八○四）","year_int":804},"message":"success","success":true}